[00:00.00]1. Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:03.98]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:07.96]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:11.94]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:15.92]By his love God made provision;
[00:19.90]We may freely take his hand.
[00:23.88]So we make our dedication;
[00:27.86]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[00:31.84]2. In this day of Satan’s anger,
[00:35.82]As the end is drawing ever near,
[00:39.80]We are faced with opposition
[00:43.78]That could make us turn away in fear.
[00:47.76]But Jehovah gives protection;
[00:51.74]Close to him we want to stay,
[00:55.72]That we might forever serve him.
[00:59.70]Love him loyally, never stray.
[01:03.68]3. Help for us God has provided
[01:07.66]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[01:11.64]Through the Christian congregation,
[01:15.62]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[01:19.60]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[01:23.58]He will help us do what’s right.
[01:27.56]He will help us to be loyal
[01:31.54]And walk modestly in his sight.